  "notes": "Site custom properties (--ds-v1-*) are declared in rem against a non-16px assumption (--ds-v1-heading-3xl: 2.8rem renders as 46px h1); the scale above is normalized to the COMPUTED px values from the profile and screenshots, converted at 16px/rem. Weight 100/600/900 counts (2/5/1) are third-party widgets, dropped. `--ds-v1-text-*` sizes (0.8rem/0.9rem) contradict the computed 20px body — screenshots and the computed profile win. Grey #A1A1AA and blues #007AFF/#32446B belong to Stripe iframes and the consent widget, not the design system; dropped. Spacing ramp is a full 4px linear series 4→200px in the source; sampled here at the values actually used. No dark theme: `craft.theme.supportsDark: false` — the dark band is #222520 used as a section ground, not a re-theme, so `color.dark` is omitted. Motion: `respectsReducedMotion: false`, `prmRules: 0`; entrance reveals and IntersectionObservers are zero — the page does not animate content into view."
